{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_sophia_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sophia_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "獨家訪談",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sophia_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c7deca4fc768a3ec2d46df67cd0d8d4539988ff85ff94a338908938a92daa5c2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一份《中央新聞報》，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......佐菲婭？好久不見了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是呀，埃爾，我也很震驚，你的報刊亭居然還開著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，托老客戶的福，還沒有倒閉呢。嘿，問問，那個最近總是掛在頭版上的騎士，是你的侄女嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭？什麼侄女，她是妹妹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，記住了記住了，我看了她和鏽銅的那場比賽，有些你當年的倔強和執拗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我？不應該更像瑪嘉烈嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不不不，我沒認錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，埃爾，沒必要追究了，說到底，那都已經是過去的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，看看這些報紙上的新聞，每年說的都是不一樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前些年鋪天蓋地全是血騎士的消息，今年再看，不少新晉的騎士也登上了頭條。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看到了，瑪莉婭也在裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有那麼一段時間，那些媒體對你也是緊追不放啊。哎，你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "《四季時報》......好像是新創立的報紙，以前從沒有看到過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，看這標題——《鞭刃騎士以教練身份“重返”賽場，指導瑪莉婭·臨光戰平屠夫英格拉》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想不到居然還有記者願意關注我現在的生活，看來我上周末在商場爆買的消息還不夠無聊，還是趕不走他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在的記者和往日不同了，以前他們銜蜜，現在他們食腐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不過這似乎是個正經的傢伙，用詞考究，文風也不花哨。來，看這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“......讓我們拭目以待，在鞭刃騎士的指導下，這位來自臨光家的小將是否可以在競技場創造獨屬於自己的輝煌？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“而鞭刃騎士是否又能重整心態，在她的新賽道上向前進發？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "恐怕......他要失望了，只不過是暫時帶帶孩子罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要買一份帶回家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用了，我這些天接收的消息已經夠多了，埃爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回見，佐菲婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一份《中央新聞報》，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......佐菲婭？許久不見了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也開始賣起騎士周邊產品了嗎，埃爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些小玩偶可幫我賺了不少錢，佐菲婭。尤其是耀騎士的，嘖嘖，一天六十個，報紙一天才賣幾份啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我可以幫你帶句感謝的話給瑪嘉烈，她知道的話，一定很開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，這樣的話，最該感謝她的不應該是那些聞風而動的記者嗎？耀騎士的回歸可給他們帶來了不少話題和銷量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "說不定我也應該謝謝她，要不是她回來了，說不定我還在煩惱要怎麼陪著瑪莉婭堅持到下一次比賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在輕鬆多了，我在鄉下看好了一處別墅，打算出手買下，等到塵埃落定，我就搬到那裡去住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別啊，這個地方還有在意你的人。喏，給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "《四季時報》......居然還在出版？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不僅如此，它還設立了一個專欄專門報導你的消息，看這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "《鞭刃放棄執教瑪莉婭，欲重回舊日奢靡生活》，怎麼說......我的生活也稱不上奢靡吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那看和誰比了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖嘖，看看他寫的，真是每一個字眼都能透出些恨鐵不成鋼來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讀出來，埃爾，讓我聽聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的嗎？他用詞還挺激烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，讀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“瑪莉婭退賽後，鞭刃也放棄以教練身份回到賽場，這一選擇令人失望。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“退役後她或許早已忘卻騎士精神，淪為躺在豐厚積蓄上不思進取的庸人。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噗嗤——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他這麼寫你，你居然還笑得出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看這語氣，就是個不諳世事的孩子，我和他有什麼好生氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用收了，埃爾。這份報紙我也買走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回見，佐菲婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一份《中央新聞報》，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭，許久不見了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "泰特斯？你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你又為什麼會在這裡？我還以為你買報紙也會有僕人代勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，小子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "埃爾，我自己會和他說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（聳肩）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這幾天為什麼總見你到處亂跑呢，泰特斯？看來你的退役生活很充實啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "確實比不上你，背靠我們的冠軍耀騎士，自然是能過舒心的好日子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，不對，我忘了，推掉那麼多商業活動，或許我們的冠軍還得依靠你呢。怎麼樣，最近忙壞了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然知道我很忙，你為什麼還要講那麼多廢話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（撇嘴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我在商業聯合會有些管道，決賽後知道了些......消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在新建成的地塊上，他們有意向建一座新的競技場。估計到時候，附近會開發新的商業區，我覺得是個不錯的投資方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我還沒說完......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭，以你的消費水準，家業再大，也會有花完的一天。更不要提，你去年開掉的那幾個中飽私囊的僕人，嘖，那可是好大一筆錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你管不著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嘁，既然你不願意，那就算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對了，就是好心說那麼一句，佐菲婭，你還很年輕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "泰特斯，你有話可以直說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......總之，為自己想想吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，謝謝你的關心，慢走，不送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小子，走之前還要買份報紙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泰特斯·白楊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看來耀騎士奪冠後，不少人都找上門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "瑪嘉烈......唉，我又不能不管她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些年你為臨光家的孩子操心太多了，佐菲婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "畢竟是曾經一起長大的，而且家族淵源又那麼......\n喂，埃爾！你在藏什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳，沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拿過來給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......給，就是那個毛頭孩子搞的專欄，你別生氣，他什麼都不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "專欄內沒有文章，只有一張偌大的圖片佔據了整個版面。\n那是總決賽時坐在觀眾席中的自己，摻雜在臉上的擔憂、不安和濃濃的自豪被相機捕捉得一清二楚。\n甚至，眼底那一絲幾不可察的豔羨也未能逃過敏銳的鏡頭。\n而圖片上面，一行黑粗的標題十分醒目：\n《臨光家最優秀的陪侍》"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "多大膽的孩子啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佐菲婭隨手扯過一旁的報紙將圖片遮去一半，蓋住觀眾席中的面孔，只留下賽場上那個發出耀眼光芒的騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回見，埃爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭小姐，佐菲婭小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......誰？我這是在哪裡......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醒醒，您快醒醒，太好了終於找到您了，真是嚇死了，您怎麼睡在樹叢裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......昨天太興奮了，好久沒有喝過那麼多了。莉莉，幫個忙扶我起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們都回去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，派對上，瑪嘉烈和瑪莉婭小姐都喝醉了，不久前管家安排司機把她們都送回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "瑪恩納呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您忘了嗎？昨天派對還沒有開到一半，瑪恩納先生就離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......估計那個時候我已經喝了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您好久都沒有這樣放縱地喝酒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為瑪嘉烈慶功嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，我扶您去臥室裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "誰，給我出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放開我！放開我！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "記者？你是怎麼進來的？！佐菲婭小姐，需要我報警嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用，你先回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放心，我會親自把這個小傢伙丟到牆外去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有需要的話請隨時呼喚我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你多大了？十五？十六？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我成年了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "《四季時報》......原來你就是那個記者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請把胸牌還給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "私闖民宅是犯罪，你不知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對不起......我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然都追到這裡了，有什麼想問我的，不如都直接問出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有膽子跑到我家裡來，就沒膽子坐在我家的沙發上嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "坐吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就當作一次訪談，相信那些問題，你已經準備很久了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我剛入職......還沒有做過採訪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那正好，做次練習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃......很抱歉，我一時衝動闖進你的房子，蹲監獄還是賠償，我都願意接——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一般情況下，採訪應該是先從自我介紹開始，這部分我可以替你做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我叫佐菲婭，退役的鞭刃騎士，耀騎士和瑪莉婭的姐妹，準確來說是姑媽，但是隨便吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還有金棕銀行的貴賓，星光大街各大商場的超級VIP，地產商人的冤大頭客戶......對了，還差一個，娛樂小報偶爾的關注對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是這樣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我是什麼樣的？在你眼中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你比賽時的錄影我全部看過，還有那些報導，我每一篇都看了......不同時期的你，有不同的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就從你記憶最深刻的模樣開始說起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，找到了，就是這一次......你那時就像瑪莉婭一樣，也紮著馬尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "耀騎士離開後，臨光家的頹勢不可挽回，而你走上競技場，希望代替她挽救一切......我還有當時的照片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "都是好久以前的事情了，這張照片，我自己都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，瑪嘉烈遠走他鄉，瑪恩納不願成為騎士，寧願打起領帶去坐辦公室，我不得不站出來承擔些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是為了臨光家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然不，沐浴過耀騎士的光芒，我心裡難免會受到鼓舞，想手執利劍以一己之力挑破籠罩在卡西米爾之上的暗幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你沒能做到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，這一張照片你又是哪裡搞來的，給我毀掉！太醜了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要！我花了很大力氣才買到的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們這些孩子，真是不可思議。為什麼要辛辛苦苦去收集騎士們鼻青臉腫的照片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是你最後一次出現在賽場上的照片，自從你敗在裂隙手下，止步十六強，就沒人在競技場見過你的身影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的左手受傷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你卻用右手堅持到了最後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝謝你提醒我，你不說我差點忘了呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我不該提這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒關係，負傷只是我決定退役的一部分原因，還有些埋藏得太深，不許當時的我深思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在想想，更多是因為失望。雖然之前有過預想，但真正接觸過騎士競技光鮮之下的骯髒後，我實在找不到繼續堅持下去的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是每個人都可以像耀騎士那樣，能夠用自身持續不斷的光芒驅散所到之處的黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "更多的人，只能倒在黎明前夜，就算劍指天空，也只能揮向無窮的黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你還是願意擔任瑪莉婭·臨光的教練，助她在賽場綻放光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是教她如何在黑暗中存活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我教不了她，我自己都做不到的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的意思是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是她自己做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "無論是瑪莉婭還是瑪嘉烈......我都自歎弗如。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至少......那些她們取得的成就能令你開心，那也很好，就像《競技午報》裡報導的那樣，你為她們感到驕傲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對，“臨光家優秀的陪侍”，《四季時報》也這麼評價，所見略同呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我當時只是圖一時之快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（搖頭）哈哈，放心，我向來不會把這些話放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你的表情不是那樣說的，我看到了，那天你在報亭，你的表情和往常不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這話聽起來太詭異了......小姑娘，你到底不知不覺跟拍了我多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "跟拍的話，最近幾個月，但是關注，有六年零二十八天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你遲早要進監獄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對，但我會獲得一個記者能得到的最大榮譽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......算了，我不關心。繼續說回來吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看到那張圖片的瞬間，我終於想明白了有些一直不確定的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我承認自己羡慕瑪嘉烈，但一直以來，我都不知道自己在羡慕她的什麼，武力、源石技藝、天馬的身份，或者是那個“臨光”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但那些都不是，你不會因為那些羡慕耀騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是難過，自己不能像她一樣，自始至終都朝著一個目標衝鋒，義無反顧，不畏苦暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你沒有想過重回賽場嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我寧死不願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那......你會懷念往日在賽場的時光嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至少那時候，我知道自己想要什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你說的這些，我可以寫成文章刊登出去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "隨便你，我不在乎，我在乎的人也不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下周你會買一份《四季時報》看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那也是下周的事了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一份《中央新聞報》，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "給，小丫頭，這年頭像你這麼愛看報的人可不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大叔，你的話太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，老派作風啊，等人的時候順便再買份報紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你跟拍她那麼久，真以為我看不見你報紙後面的相機嗎？這不，你等的人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看見熟悉的身影，反應了一下，記者舉起了自己的相機對準馬路對面的女人。\n她右手舉著一杯剛買的咖啡，杯口冒著滾燙的熱氣。\n走至車旁，她把咖啡杯從右手換到左手，準備從包裡拿鑰匙。她的左手不便，咖啡很燙，所以她只能用一個彆扭的姿勢緊緊抓住杯子。\n路人見她窘迫，幾次上前想要幫助她，卻都被她謝絕。\n看到女人一臉痛苦地咬牙從包裡翻找鑰匙，記者不由得捏緊了相機。\n這副面色讓她回憶起自己看過的錄影裡，女人也是以這樣的表情對抗各色強敵。\n經過一陣讓人牙酸的等待，終於，女人從包裡翻到了那串鑰匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你為什麼把相機放下了？不拍了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有必要拍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那串鑰匙，就在她包裡，遲早有天，她會把它翻出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，你這孩子，騎車小心點，把手放在握把上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回見了，老傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，這毛頭孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "晚上好，埃爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報刊亭主",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，來份《中央新聞報》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，一份《四季時報》，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
